VAR npcEmotion = "Angry"

Welcome Back Mr Kim, Just got the news we have now destroyed their factory. #speaker:Maggie
-> MissionBriefing

=== MissionBriefing ===  

New Mission for you and this time it is at the broadcasting station, we need to switch that off till the entire false news issue has been contained. #speaker:Maggie  

* Got it. Where do I start? #speaker:Player  
    First, you’ll need a **mission key**. Play the **media game** at the **arcade computer** to generate one. Once you have it, input the key into the **console** to begin. #speaker:Maggie  
    -> StartMission  

=== StartMission ===  
The city is counting on you. Stop the false stories before disaster strikes back. Good luck, Agent. #speaker:Maggie  
-> END
